WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.112
Who is this for?

2
00:00:01.112 --> 00:00:04.813
Developers build and maintain
the library and its checks.

3
00:00:04.813 --> 00:00:07.519
Identity engineers own the group library,

4
00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:11.387
and every rule file names the
owner who approves its changes.

5
00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:15.624
Reviewers approve each change, with
the shadow diff in front of them.

6
00:00:15.624 --> 00:00:18.225
And each step asks for the least it needs.

7
00:00:18.225 --> 00:00:22.512
Creating groups needs group write rights
with the Groups Administrator role.

8
00:00:22.512 --> 00:00:26.999
Testing a rule with Graph needs only
read rights when you supply the rule.

9
00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:29.924
Pausing administrative
units is the heavier one:

10
00:00:29.924 --> 00:00:32.620
it needs the Privileged
Role Administrator.
